SOAPBOX: Way too many ops still do not understand how to operate SPLIT properly on DIGI. I think the HOLD TX FREQ check box needs to be bigger, and highlighted with red or yellow caution background, with a note to please read the instructions thoroughly before operating. I lost track of how many ops came to my DF to answer my CQ and then proceeded to take over my calling freq immediately after the Q, and began calling CQ! I have zero tolerance for this practice, and I delete those contacts from the log. Maybe enough NIL showing up on those results will open some eyes.
SOAPBOX: 73, Gene N9TF
SOAPBOX: K3S 100 watts to 6BTV ground mounted with 32 radials, and a shorty 160m inverted L 22' vertical to knee with 110' horizontal wire running westerly.
